# Platform shell notifications (bell / inbox)

**When:** delivering an item into the **VTC shell chrome bell** (sidebar inbox on `app.vtc.com` / `beta.vtc.com`).

**Not this:**

| Mechanism | Rule / use |
|-----------|------------|
| Transactional **email** / **SMS** | `POST /api/v1/notifications/email` · `…/sms` — `nextjs-to-vite.mdc` |
| App-local toasts / in-app lists | Your app UI only — never the shell bell |
| iframe `postMessage` | Child→shell bridge has **no** notification type (`app-integration.mdc`) |
| `wss://ws.vtc.com` | Generic app realtime — `realtime.mdc` — **not** the shell bell |

**Shell repo:** `~/apps/app` (not the empty `posif-svelte` stub). **ZAPI:** `~/apps/dev/src/zapi`.

---

## Architecture

```
Platform ZAPI service
  → MySQL user_notifications
  → POST chat.vtc.com/api/internal/notifications/deliver  (X-Internal-Secret)
  → Socket.IO  notification:new  → room user:{userId}
  → optional FCM push
Shell (~/apps/app)
  → REST hydrate + mark-read
  → listens notification:new for live badge/list
```

**Scoped by JWT user id** — not `group_id`. `group_id` may appear only inside `payload` for deep links / FCM.

---

## Create (platform server only)

**No public child-app create API today.** `@vtc/sdk` / `@vtc/client` / `@vtc/ui` have no inbox helpers.

Canonical write path — ZAPI only:

```python
# ~/apps/dev/src/zapi/services/notification_dispatch_service.py
await NotificationDispatchService(db).create_and_deliver(
    user_ids=[29457],
    category="invite",  # invite | app_transfer | system | …
    title="…",
    body="…",
    payload={
        "deep_link": "/dashboard/apps",  # shell path or absolute URL
        "group_id": "123",
        "type": "invite",
    },
    send_push=True,
    project="posif",
)
```

**Callers today:** invite admin, app ownership transfer — extend a **platform ZAPI service** the same way. Do not invent iframe messaging or app-route “notify shell” hacks.

**Item shape** (DB / socket / SW):

```json
{
  "id": "42",
  "user_id": "7",
  "category": "app_transfer",
  "title": "…",
  "body": "…",
  "message": "…",
  "payload": { "deep_link": "/dashboard/apps", "group_id": "123", "type": "app_transfer" },
  "read_status": "0",
  "created_date": "2026-01-15 12:00:00",
  "from_details": { "id": "0", "user_nickname": "Platform" }
}
```

